  title: Rank & Flow State
  description: 'Perform <color=white>skilled actions</color> to gain Rank Point and
    Flowing Mind.

    Higher Rank increases your <color=white>score multiplier</color>.

    Gain
    Flowing Mind to enter <color=white>Flow States</color>, but taking damage will
    <color=white>reduce both</color>.

'
